lorie: reject incoherent AHB GPU Present paths

Probe whether CPU and GLES observe the same AHardwareBuffer contents before
enabling GPU Present. Fall back to the synchronized CPU path when they do not,
without maintaining a vendor or device blacklist.

Based on termux/termux-x11@501f72f8e1183e62925951551bf631586145c1e6
from termux/termux-x11#1148.

